  "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <br>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/antonmedv/walk/raw/master/.github/images/demo.gif\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Walk Demo\">\n  <br>\n</p>\n\nWalk — a terminal file manager.\n\n**In this release:**\n- **Added paste**: yank a file or directory with <kbd>y</kbd>, then press <kbd>p</kbd> to copy it into the current directory, by @KrisF-Midnight in https://github.com/antonmedv/walk/pull/181\n- Fixed: pasting a directory into itself no longer recurses endlessly\n- Added `install.sh` script for quick installation\n- README: use `<kbd>` tags by @noelleleigh in https://github.com/antonmedv/walk/pull/164\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/antonmedv/walk/compare/v1.13.0...v1.14.0\n",
